  三打白骨精  ✓ 村姑 → ✓ 老妇人 → ✓ 老公公  (write)

  VICTORY!  胜利!

  悟空第三次举起金箍棒，白骨精再也变不了了。地上只剩下一堆白骨，骨头上写着「白
  骨夫人」四个字。师父这才相信了悟空。
  Wukong raises his golden-banded staff a third time, and the White Bone Demon
  can change no more. All that is left on the ground is a heap of white bones,
  and on the bones are written four characters: 'Lady White Bone'. Only now
  does the master believe Wukong.

  Tribulation 20 cleared! The road west opens.
